title UC.25 - Daily Automated Shift Consolidation via Local LLM

|System Scheduler / Dept Manager|
start
:1. Trigger Daily Shift Consolidation\n(Cron job at 23:00 or manual Manager trigger);

|GraphMind Consolidation Service|
:2. Query PostgreSQL shift_reports where\nreport_date = target_date AND status = APPROVED;
if (Any APPROVED shift reports found?) then (No [E1])
  :Log info: "No approved shift reports for target date";
  :Terminate consolidation job cleanly without error;
  stop
else (Yes)
  :3. Aggregate shift tasks, incidents & manager remarks;
  :4. Build structured ChatML consolidation prompt;
  :5. Send inference request to Local Ollama API (timeout = 30s);
endif

|Ollama Local LLM Engine|
if (Service reachable & responds <= 30s?) then (Yes [Main Flow])
  :6a. Generate structured Markdown summary\n(Shift statistics, key highlights, risks, recommendations);
  |GraphMind Consolidation Service|
  :7a. Parse Markdown & structured metrics;
  :8a. Set flag is_fallback_generated = false;
else (No [E2: Timeout > 30s / Offline])
  |GraphMind Consolidation Service|
  :6b. Catch TimeoutError / ConnectionError;
  :7b. Write warning OLLAMA_FALLBACK_TRIGGERED to audit_logs;
  :8b. Execute Rule-Based Deterministic Fallback (FR57):\nCompile mechanical statistics & tabular shift/incident list;
  :9b. Set flag is_fallback_generated = true;
endif

:10. Persist summary record in shift_daily_summaries table;
:11. Publish Daily Shift Summary to Executive & Manager Dashboard;
stop
@enduml